		     (PhyDelayedExec, MT-guvenli). SimIG: BucketBody->BucketBodyPose
		     (12983), DraglineBlade gorselsiz (DraglineBladeBodyPose).
		     BucketTop/Bottom (12984/12985) Phy.xml'de DEGIL -> pure SR Mat44
		     (mesh'leri Model/FBX high-poly; cook etme = §13.1 spike kacin).
		     relativePosition = ilk spawn; apply() her tick override eder.
		     Terrain deform mantigi Step 4: DraglineBlade SELF_CONDUCTIVE + isim
		     "DraglineBlade" (terrain mtDragline eslesmesi) + deform-attr tasir;
		     DragPullForce/RopeHorizontalInput=0 oldugundan deform GATE kapali. -->
